{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Golden Coconut is found throughout ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," and can be obtained by shaking ",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s (10% chance when there is a coconut visible), digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],", or from a ",["l","蓝铁饼鱼","Blue Discus"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," with a population of at least 9."]],["p",["It can also be purchased from the ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," for 10 ",["l","椰子","Coconut"],"s after previously finding and cracking at least one golden coconut."]],["p",["Golden Coconuts can be cracked by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g, similar to ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Geode"],"s. However, unlike Geodes, they cannot be broken open using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]]]],["Contents",2,[["p",["The first golden coconut to be cracked will always produce a ",["l","金色核桃","Golden Walnut"],". Afterwards, Golden Coconuts have a chance to produce the following items."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]}],[[["f","Banana_Sapling.png",24]],[["l","香蕉树苗","Banana Sapling"]]],[[["f","Mango_Sapling.png",24]],[["l","芒果幼苗","Mango Sapling"]]],[[["f","Pineapple_Seeds.png",24]],[["l","菠萝种子","Pineapple Seeds"]," (5)"]],[[["f","Taro_Tuber.png",24]],[["l","芋头块茎","Taro Tuber"]," (5)"]],[[["f","Mahogany_Seed.png",24]],[["l","桃花心木种子","Mahogany Seed"]]],[[["f","Fossilized_Skull.png",24]],[["l","颅骨化石","Fossilized Skull"]]],[[["f","Iridium_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铱矿石","Iridium Ore"]," (5)"]],[[["f","Golden_Helmet.png",24]],[["l","金色头盔","Golden Helmet"]]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["The Golden Coconut is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Island Bikini"],". ",["f","Island_Bikini.png",24]," It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a yellow dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Tips",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The player can skip having to forage by buying 10 ",["l","椰子","Coconut"],"s from the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"]," on Mondays, then trading them with the ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," for 1 Golden Coconut."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5.4","1.5.4"],": Fixed bug where ",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s in ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"]," would produce Golden Coconuts."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","采集","Foraging"]," • ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," • ",["l","蓝铁饼鱼","Blue Discus"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]]],["Season",["All"]]]}